        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For hospitals and health systems, we provide highly-scalable connected care solutions -- including hardware, software and services — that help organizations deliver telehealth services to their patients in virtual care and hybrid care models.",
        "start_character": 2592,
        "end_character": 2834
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In many jurisdictions where we operate, neither our current nor our anticipated business model has been the subject of judicial or administrative interpretation.",
        "start_character": 40181,
        "end_character": 40342
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The non-clinical functions and services we provide under the services agreements primarily include member management services, such as maintaining network operations centers for our members to request a visit with the THMG Association’s and the Uplift Association’s providers, member billing and collection administration, and maintenance and storage of member medical records.",
        "start_character": 36484,
        "end_character": 36861
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our BetterHelp segment, we are also a leading provider of virtual mental health therapy in the consumer market, both in terms of the number of individuals enrolled and the number of licensed professionals who provide services on the platform.",
        "start_character": 26439,
        "end_character": 26689
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To provide further flexibility, we are enabling users to use insurance benefits coverage for mental health services through BetterHelp.",
        "start_character": 27636,
        "end_character": 27771
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the services agreements with THMG and Uplift PC, we have agreed to serve, on an exclusive basis, as manager and administrator of the THMG Association’s and Uplift Association’s non-clinical functions and services related to the provision of the telehealth services by providers employed by or under contract with the THMG Association or Uplift Association, respectively.",
        "start_character": 36107,
        "end_character": 36483
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide a broad range of programs and services, including primary and specialty care, chronic care, mental health, expert medical services, as well as virtual care technology and hardware for care delivery.",
        "start_character": 8225,
        "end_character": 8439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also actively building new solutions to bring additional value to our Clients and members, such as our Wellbound employee assistance program offering.",
        "start_character": 26281,
        "end_character": 26438
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are further leveraging advanced AI and machine learning to launch innovative offerings, elevate care delivery and create scalable, personalized experiences.",
        "start_character": 17632,
        "end_character": 17791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our history of innovation and unmatched scale provide us with significant first-mover advantages, and we continue to invest and expand our services and geographic footprint globally.",
        "start_character": 7286,
        "end_character": 7479
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We enter into business support services contracts with these physician-owned professional associations and professional corporations pursuant to which we provide them with non-clinical functions and services related to the provision of the telehealth services by the providers, such as maintaining network operations centers for our members to request a visit with the providers, member billing and collection administration, and maintenance and storage of member medical records, and the professional associations and professional corporations pay us for those services out of the fees they collect from patients and third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 42656,
        "end_character": 43293
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477449-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477449-26-000012-67214e8e2f48bc59",
        "accession_number": "0001477449-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have invested, and expect to continue to invest, significant resources in research and development and acquisitions to enhance our existing solutions and introduce innovative products and capabilities.",
        "start_character": 33119,
        "end_character": 33323
      }
    ]
